 tepercaya. SCTV juga merupakan destinasi utama bagi penggemar olahraga dunia serta panggung megah bagi berbagai program hiburan dan awards night paling bergengsi. Selalu kreatif dan inspiratif, SCTV tetap menjadi pilihan nomor satu bagi keluarga Indonesia.\\n\\nSaksikan seluruh tayangan SCTV secara Live Streaming maupun Catch-up hanya di Vidio.\",\"web_url\":\"https://www.vidio.com/live/204-sctv\",\"cover_url\":\"https://thumbor.prod.vidiocdn.com/kH-K9J4cROqL0TZrAyQhw7P5pBk=/230x230/filters:quality(70)/vidio-web-prod-livestreaming/uploads/livestreaming/square_image/204/4e9f5c.png\",\"recommendation_source\":null,\"segments\":[],\"negative_segments\":[]},\"links\":{\"self\":{\"href\":\"https://api.vidio.com/livestreamings/204\"}},\"meta\":{\"events\":{\"click\":{\"event_name\":\"VIDIO::CATEGORY_PAGE\",\"attributes\":{\"action\":\"click\",\"category_name\":\"Live\",\"section\":\"Siaran Pilihan\",\"section_id\":\"4625\",\"section_position\":4,\"content_id\":204,\"content_title\":\"SCTV\",\"content_type\":\"livestreaming\",\"data_source\":\"none\",\"segments\":[],\"category_id\":55,\"recommendation_source\":null,\"variation\":\"circle_horizontal\"}},\"impression\":{\"event_name\":\"VIDIO::CATEGORY_PAGE\",\"attributes\":{\"action\":\"impression_content\",\"category_name\":\"Live\",\"section\":\"Siaran Pilihan\",\"section_id\":\"4625\",\"section_position\":4,\"content_id\":204,\"content_title\":\"SCTV\",\"content_type\":\"livestreaming\",\"data_source\":\"none\",\"segments\":[],\"category_id\":55,\"recommendation_source\":null,\"variation\":\"circle_horizontal\"}}}}},{\"id\":\"section-4625-livestreaming-22252\",\"type\":\"content\",\"attributes\":{\"content_id\":22252,\"content_type\":\"livestreaming\",\"title\":\"Bloomberg TV\",\"description\":\"\",\"web_url\":\"https://www.vidio.com/live/22252-bloomberg-tv\",\"cover_url\":\"https://thumbor.prod.vidiocdn.com/5383je3X8Fd8Z62ixQXN27SWrXY=/230x230/filters:quality(70)/vidio-web-prod-livestreaming/uploads/livestreaming/squar